cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Chipper-8"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency CHIP-8 virtual machine, two-pass assembler, and 1977 RCA
  COSMAC VIP hardware logic analyzer bench that runs in the browser and in
  Node.js. Includes four original CHIP-8 games, a cycle-accurate bus trace, a
  RAM window around the program counter, and switchable interpreter quirks.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/chipper-8"
url: "https://draarivpatel-ui.github.io/chipper-8/"
keywords:
